'''Icebreaker''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 20th tier in the Main Event for 70,000 [[Snow Tokens]] {{Currency|Snow Token}} during the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.  

==Appearance==
Icebreaker takes a similar shape to the [[BattleAxe]], but larger. It has a thin, long purple handle with a sharp icy knob at the bottom. The axe appears to be a labrys with two blades encased in ice. It has a demon-like face in the middle with silver horns, icy blue eyes, a black, thin nose and sharp metal teeth.

==Trivia ==
*It is the 2nd [[:Category:Ancient|ancient]] knife that is not a scythe, the first being [[Logchopper]], and the others being [[Traveler's Axe]], [[Swirly Axe]] (which has a similiar design) and [[Icecrusher]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*There are [[Red Icebreaker|red]], [[Bronze Icebreaker|bronze]], [[Silver Icebreaker|silver]] and [[Gold Icebreaker|gold]] reskins of this knife for the Christmas 2020 leaderboards.
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Iceblaster]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Ice Set|Icebreaker Set]].

